1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,903
Flor explained vertical resistance.

2
00:00:02,903 --> 00:00:11,614
For every resistance gene, R, in the host, there is a matching avirulence gene, Avr, in the pathogen.

3
00:00:11,614 --> 00:00:17,239
The plant resists only when both are present, like a lock that only works with its key.

4
00:00:17,239 --> 00:00:20,781
In every other combination, the disease wins.

